# Outfit head (R18): a noir fedora, wide brim at the brow, creased crown, accent band.
# Head frame: the head fills x 3..8, y 3..7, z 0..5 (pivot 5 5 0).
name outfit_fedora
grid 5
size 11 10 8
slot felt SwatchMain
slot band SwatchAccent
cyl 5.5 5 4 5 4.6 felt
cyl 5.5 5 5 7 2.9 felt
box 4 4 7 8 6 8 felt
carve box 4 4 6.5 8 6 7
carve box 3 3 4 8 7 5
paint cyl 5.5 5 5 6 2.9 band
pivot 5 5 0
